###
# CCI Department Guidance System - API Test Requests
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code
# Instructions:
#   1. Install "REST Client" extension by Huachao Mao
#   2. Click "Send Request" above each request
#   3. Update @assessmentId variable after starting assessment
###

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@assessmentId = REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-ASSESSMENT-ID

### ============================================
### HEALTH & STATUS
### ============================================

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. API Info
GET {{baseUrl}}

### ============================================
### DEPARTMENTS
### ============================================

### 3. Get All Departments
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments

### 4. Get Single Department - Computer Science
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/CS

### 5. Get Single Department - Software Engineering
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/SWE

### 6. Get Single Department - Information Technology
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/IT

### 7. Get Department Curriculum - CS
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/CS/curriculum

### 8. Get Department Curriculum - SWE
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/SWE/curriculum

### 9. Search Departments - "software"
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/search?q=software

### 10. Search Departments - "data"
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/search?q=data

### 11. Search Departments - "network"
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/search?q=network

### 12. Compare Departments - CS, SWE, IT
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department_codes": ["CS", "SWE", "IT"]
}

### 13. Compare Departments - All Six
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department_codes": ["CS", "SWE", "IT", "IS", "ISC", "STAT"]
}

### ============================================
### ASSESSMENTS - Complete Flow
### ============================================

### 14. Start Assessment (Anonymous)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments/start
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 15. Start Assessment (With Student Info)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_name": "Asladin Abdukedir",
  "student_email": "asladin@haramaya.edu"
}

### 16. Save Response (Replace IDs with actual values from start response)
# @name saveResponse
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "REPLACE-WITH-QUESTION-UUID",
  "option_id": "REPLACE-WITH-OPTION-UUID"
}

### 17. Get Assessment Progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/progress

### 18. Submit Assessment (After answering all 20 questions)
# @name submitAssessment
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

### 19. Get Assessment Results
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/results

### ============================================
### FEEDBACK
### ============================================

### 20. Submit Feedback - Excellent
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessment_id": "{{assessmentId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent guidance system! Very helpful and accurate.",
  "helpful": true,
  "would_recommend": true
}

### 21. Submit Feedback - Good
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessment_id": "DIFFERENT-ASSESSMENT-ID",
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Good experience overall.",
  "helpful": true
}

### 22. Submit Feedback - Minimum Required
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessment_id": "ANOTHER-ASSESSMENT-ID",
  "rating": 3
}

### 23. Get Feedback Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/feedback/stats

### ============================================
### ERROR TESTING (Should return appropriate errors)
### ============================================

### 24. Invalid Department Code (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/INVALID

### 25. Invalid Assessment ID (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/results

### 26. Missing Required Field (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessment_id": "{{assessmentId}}"
  # Missing required "rating" field
}

### 27. Invalid Rating Value (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessment_id": "{{assessmentId}}",
  "rating": 10
}

### 28. Search Query Too Short (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/search?q=a

### 29. Compare Less Than 2 Departments (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department_codes": ["CS"]
}

### 30. Compare More Than 6 Departments (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department_codes": ["CS", "SWE", "IT", "IS", "ISC", "STAT", "EXTRA"]
}

### ============================================
### SAMPLE COMPLETE ASSESSMENT WORKFLOW
### ============================================

###
# STEP 1: Start new assessment
# Copy the assessment_id from response
###
# @name startWorkflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_name": "Test Workflow",
  "student_email": "workflow@test.com"
}

###
# STEP 2: Get the questions from the response above
# Then save 20 responses (one per question)
# Use the question IDs and option IDs from the start response
###

###
# STEP 3: Check progress
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/progress

###
# STEP 4: Submit after all 20 responses
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/submit

###
# STEP 5: View results
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/results

###
# STEP 6: Submit feedback
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessment_id": "{{assessmentId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Workflow test completed successfully!",
  "helpful": true
}

### ============================================
### NOTES
### ============================================
#
# Variable Usage:
# - Update @assessmentId at the top after starting an assessment
# - Or use {{startWorkflow.response.body.data.assessment_id}} syntax
#
# Response Variables:
# - @name directive saves response for later use
# - Access with {{requestName.response.body.path.to.value}}
#
# Tips:
# - Click "Send Request" link above each ### block
# - View response in right panel
# - Status codes: 200 OK, 201 Created, 400 Bad Request, 404 Not Found, 500 Error
#
### ============================================
